  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p>Welcome to Hillside Candle's Affiliate Program! We're delighted to partner with passionate individuals who share our love for scents and stories. At Hillside Candle, we craft more than just candles; we curate experiences that kindle emotions and spark memories.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Our candles are more than just sources of light and fragrance; they are vessels of stories waiting to be told. Crafted with care and precision, each Hillside Candle is a testament to quality, sustainability, and the art of storytelling through scent. With a range of fragrances that evoke nostalgia, warmth, and serenity, our candles illuminate every moment.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p>What sets Hillside Candle apart is our unwavering commitment to quality and sustainability. Our candles are crafted using 85%+ vegetable oil, ensuring a cleaner and longer burn. We take pride in our fragrances, meticulously designed to kindle emotions and create lasting memories. When you become a part of our affiliate program, you're endorsing not just a product but a fragrant journey.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p>As a valued affiliate partner, you'll earn a generous 10% commission on each sale generated through your unique affiliate link. We believe in rewarding your efforts in spreading the Hillside Candle magic. Payments are made on a regular basis, ensuring you reap the benefits of your partnership promptly.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n</div>",
